---
/**
 * Sezione di presentazione visiva e immersiva delle 3 categorie principali di Brilla Cafe:
 * 1. Cartoleria & Scuola (cartoleria.jpg)
 * 2. Edicola del Mese (edicola.jpg)
 * 3. Bar, Caffè & Idee Regalo (bar.jpg)
 * Design editoriale e professionale senza emoji infantili, con fotografie reali del negozio.
 */
---

<section id="categorie" class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-white border-t border-brand-dark/10">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-14">
      <span class="px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-dark/5 text-brand-dark text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider inline-block mb-3">
        Le Nostre Categorie
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-dark tracking-tight">
        Tutto quello che cerchi, in un unico posto.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-brand-dark/65 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
        Sfoglia i nostri reparti specializzati per trovare subito ciò di cui hai bisogno: ritira comodamente in negozio o richiedi la spedizione.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      {/* 1. Cartoleria & Scuola */}
      <a
        href="/catalogo?tipo=cartoleria"
        class="group relative rounded-3xl bg-white border border-brand-dark/10 hover:border-badge-cartoleria/40 shadow-sm hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500 flex flex-col overflow-hidden focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-[#2C3E50]"
      >
        {/* Immagine Reale con Overlay Elegante */}
        <div class="relative aspect-[4/3] bg-brand-cream overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="/cartoleria.jpg"
            alt="Reparto Cartoleria e Scuola Brilla Cafe a Castelnuovo Bocca d'Adda"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-108 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-dark/80 via-brand-dark/20 to-transparent"></div>
          
          <div class="absolute top-4 left-4">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-badge-cartoleria text-white text-[11px] font-bold tracking-wide shadow-md">
              Scuola &amp; Ufficio
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 text-white">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white/80 block">Reparto 01</span>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Cartoleria</h3>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Descrizione & CTA */}
        <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-blue-50/20">
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-dark/75 leading-relaxed">
            Quadernoni, penne, zaini ergonomici, evidenziatori, diari e tutto il materiale completo per lo studio e l'ufficio.
          </p>

          <div class="pt-3 border-t border-brand-dark/5 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold text-badge-cartoleria group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all">
            <span>🎒 Esplora il Reparto Scuola</span>
            <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1.5 transition-transform text-base" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      {/* 2. Edicola & Riviste */}
      <a
        href="/catalogo?tipo=edicola"
        class="group relative rounded-3xl bg-white border border-brand-dark/10 hover:border-badge-edicola/40 shadow-sm hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500 flex flex-col overflow-hidden focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-[#2C3E50]"
      >
        {/* Immagine Reale con Overlay Elegante */}
        <div class="relative aspect-[4/3] bg-brand-cream overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="/edicola.jpg"
            alt="Reparto Edicola, Quotidiani e Riviste Brilla Cafe a Castelnuovo Bocca d'Adda"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-108 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-dark/80 via-brand-dark/20 to-transparent"></div>
          
          <div class="absolute top-4 left-4">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-badge-edicola text-white text-[11px] font-bold tracking-wide shadow-md">
              Edicola del Mese
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 text-white">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white/80 block">Reparto 02</span>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Edicola &amp; Quotidiani</h3>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Descrizione & CTA */}
        <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-emerald-50/20">
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-dark/75 leading-relaxed">
            Quotidiani nazionali del giorno, riviste di approfondimento, fumetti storici, novità da collezione e guide.
          </p>

          <div class="pt-3 border-t border-brand-dark/5 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold text-badge-edicola group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all">
            <span>📰 Scopri Quotidiani &amp; Riviste</span>
            <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1.5 transition-transform text-base" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      {/* 3. Bar, Caffè & Idee Regalo */}
      <a
        href="/catalogo?tipo=bar_gift"
        class="group relative rounded-3xl bg-white border border-brand-dark/10 hover:border-badge-gift/40 shadow-sm hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500 flex flex-col overflow-hidden focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-[#2C3E50]"
      >
        {/* Immagine Reale con Overlay Elegante */}
        <div class="relative aspect-[4/3] bg-brand-cream overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="/bar.jpg"
            alt="Bar, Caffè e Idee Regalo Artigianali Brilla Cafe a Castelnuovo Bocca d'Adda"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-108 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-dark/80 via-brand-dark/20 to-transparent"></div>
          
          <div class="absolute top-4 left-4">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-badge-gift text-white text-[11px] font-bold tracking-wide shadow-md">
              Bar &amp; Idee Regalo
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 text-white">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white/80 block">Reparto 03</span>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Bar &amp; Idee Regalo</h3>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Descrizione & CTA */}
        <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-rose-50/20">
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-dark/75 leading-relaxed">
            Tazze e mug souvenir "Brilla Castelnuovo", bottiglie termiche inox, scatole di cioccolateria artigianale e pensieri speciali.
          </p>

          <div class="pt-3 border-t border-brand-dark/5 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold text-badge-gift group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all">
            <span>🎁 Scegli Idee Regalo &amp; Caffè</span>
            <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1.5 transition-transform text-base" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
